ios-redfin bridge patch 0163: port of Yofuness/ios-flame bridge 0116-sweet-shadow-cache (commit 8c58dff, MIT).
Ported onto metal2vulkan 720ef1ce + ios-redfin 0001-0162: their 0108 refresh_always does not exist here; the cache sits beside our
0107 shadow seed (SWEET_SHADOW_SEED, checked first) and counts its skips in sweet_counts (frontend 'J copies ... skipped').
Knob: SWEET_SHADOW_CACHE=1 (hash) | 2 (ceiling test, stale content expected), also read as M2V_SHADOW_CACHE; unset/0 = as before.
Independent of the frontend's SWEET_DEADFILL (their 0116 has no DEADFILL dependency).

